y mine-graphite (on its actor), each on the one who does it, so no action ever brings business.graphite to this actor); pack-pencils (the factory has enough finished pencils: was 0, needed 1; business.pencils is raised only by asse Rules can only change the actor and the entities its fields name, and cannot add actions or fields. Return a corrected structure (JSON object only) whose actions and fields let every step and every actor happen, keeping what already worked. Keep the world's resources and laws, updated for every action you add, rename or change: a move that makes or uses up a resource belongs in that law's may_change_by, and a trade its pairing law names must still exist.", "role": "user"}], "prompt_ref": null, "control": {"timeout": 0, "num_retries": 1, "reasoning_effort": "low", "api_base": null, "base_delay": 1.0, "max_delay": 30.0, "retry_on": null, "fallback_models": null, "manual_fallback": null, "execution_mode": "text", "structured_output_mode": null, "structured_contract_ref": null, "retry_policy": {"max_retries": 1, "base_delay": 1.0, "max_delay": 30.0, "retry_on": null, "on_retry": null, "backoff": null, "should_retry": null}, "cache_policy": {"mode": "disabled"}, "max_budget": 0.2}, "kwargs": {"max_tokens": 16000, "model_policy": "enforce_allowlist"}, "response_model_fqn": null, "response_model_schema": null}, "replay": {"unsupported_keys": []}}

